# clasp push allowlist for kos-personal.
#
# clasp's default behavior recurses through the whole rootDir, and this
# directory has grown legacy/archived subfolders (archived/, three rounds
# of reupload reconciliation) and a whole separate Node.js service
# (inference-service/) that must never reach the live Apps Script project.
# Rather than deny-list each new addition (which failed to scale across
# three reconciliation rounds already), this ignores everything by default
# and explicitly un-ignores only the files that are actually part of the
# live bound project. New legacy dumps land ignored by default, safely.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!1_Config_And_Deploy.gs
!2_Ingestion_Sensors.gs
!3_Queue_Processor.gs
!4_Vector_Router.gs
!5_Error_And_Utilities.gs
!6_Governance.gs
!7_WebApp.gs
!8_WebApp_UI.html
!9_UI_Diagnostics.gs
!10_Turnstile.gs
!11_Registrar_CogRelay.gs
